// The project's audio buses: each one's volume and its effects, run first to
// last before the volume. Every bus feeds the master. Read by the editor and
// the game alike; hot reloaded; edited in Project Settings.
//
// Effects: LowPass(cutoff, q), HighPass(cutoff, q), Delay(time, feedback, mix),
// Reverb(room_size, damping, width, mix), Duck(by, depth, threshold, attack,
// release). Times in seconds, levels linear. For example:
//
//     (name: "music", effects: [Duck(by: "dialogue", depth: 0.7)]),
(
    version: 1,
    buses: [
        (name: "music"),
        (name: "sfx"),
        (name: "ui"),
    ],
)
